### Phase 3: The BUILD Phase API Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@roomId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@taskId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@checkpointId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### 1. KANBAN BOARD & TASKS

### 1.1 Get Kanban Board
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/board
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.2 List Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.3 Create Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "summary": "Implement JWT auth interceptor",
  "description": "Intercept outgoing requests with Authorization header",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "role": "Backend",
  "estimateMin": 45,
  "status": "TODO",
  "labels": ["auth", "security"]
}

### 1.4 Get Task Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.5 Update Task (with version check)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "summary": "Implement JWT auth interceptor with refresh token",
  "priority": "CRITICAL",
  "estimateMin": 60,
  "version": 1
}

### 1.6 Move Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/move
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toStatus": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "toIndex": 0
}

### 1.7 Flag Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/flag
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flagged": true,
  "reason": "OAuth provider client secret missing from dev vault"
}

### 1.8 Add Subtask
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/subtasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Configure Spring Security filter chain"
}

### 1.9 Add Acceptance Criterion
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/acceptance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Returns 401 Unauthorized for expired tokens"
}

### 1.10 Add Comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "@Alice check if we also need CORS headers configured"
}

### 1.11 Update Task Dependencies
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/dependencies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dependsOnTaskIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004"
  ]
}

### 1.12 Delete Task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json


### 2. ROOM OVERVIEW & VITALS

### 2.1 Get Room Overview (Planning or Build Variant)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/overview
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.2 Get Progress Burnup
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.3 Get Team Workload
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/workload?scope=phase
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.4 Get Navigation Badge Counters
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/nav-badges
Content-Type: application/json


### 3. PRESENCE & HEARTBEAT

### 3.1 Send Member Heartbeat
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPath": "/app/room/{{roomId}}/board",
  "currentTask": "PRD Review"
}


### 4. TEAM ROSTER & CHARTER

### 4.1 Get Team Roster
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/team
Content-Type: application/json

### 4.2 Update Team Charter
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/team/charter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamName": "ByteCrafters",
  "track": "Open Innovation",
  "rules": ["Daily standup at 9 AM", "Ship fast, iterate cleanly"]
}


### 5. CHECKPOINTS

### 5.1 Get Checkpoints
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/checkpoints
Content-Type: application/json

### 5.2 Pass Checkpoint Manually
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/checkpoints/{{checkpointId}}/pass
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passed": true
}

### 5.3 Update Rehearsal Progress
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/checkpoints/{{checkpointId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current": 2
}


### 6. MVP STUDIO

### 6.1 Get MVP State
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/mvp
Content-Type: application/json

### 6.2 Update Elevator Pitch
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/mvp/pitch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pitch": "A real-time opinionated OS guiding hackathon teams from rules to pitch."
}

### 6.3 Update Core Flow
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/mvp/core-flow
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "steps": [
    "1. Paste hackathon rules & parse rubric",
    "2. Brainstorm with silent voting rounds",
    "3. Generate PRD and schedule tasks",
    "4. Rehearse pitch with AI judge timer"
  ]
}

### 6.4 Update Scope Ledger
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/mvp/ledger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inScope": ["Auth", "Kanban Board", "Checkpoints"],
  "outOfScope": ["Third-party Jira sync", "Billing module"]
}

### 6.5 Update MVP Health Checks
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/mvp/health
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "runs": true,
  "stable": true,
  "clear30": true,
  "wow60": false
}

### 6.6 Update Judge Prep
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/mvp/judge-prep
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "q1": "We validated this with 50 student participants."
  }
}

### 6.7 Update Cut List
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/mvp/cut-list
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cutItems": ["Multi-lingual speech recognition"]
}


### 7. DOCS VAULT

### 7.1 List All Docs
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/docs
Content-Type: application/json

### 7.2 Create New Doc
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/docs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DEPLOYMENT.md",
  "content": "# Deployment Architecture\n\nRun via Docker Compose on AWS ECS."
}

### 7.3 Update Doc (with optimistic baseVersion)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/docs/DEPLOYMENT.md
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "# Deployment Architecture\n\nRun via Docker Compose on AWS ECS.\n\nHealth check at /actuator/health",
  "baseVersion": 1
}

### 7.4 Get Historical Doc Version
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/docs/DEPLOYMENT.md/versions/1
Content-Type: application/json

### 7.5 Restore Historical Doc Version
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/docs/DEPLOYMENT.md/restore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1
}

### 7.6 Download Docs Vault as ZIP
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/docs/download.zip


### 8. GLOBAL HOME & SEARCH

### 8.1 Get Global Home Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/home?roomId={{roomId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 8.2 Global Unified Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=auth&roomId={{roomId}}
Content-Type: application/json


### 9. SPEED MODE & CAPTURE

### 9.1 Get Speed Mode Queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/speed-mode
Content-Type: application/json

### 9.2 Quick Complete Next Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/done
Content-Type: application/json

### 9.3 Quick Capture Scratchpad Thought
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/capture
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Don't forget to test offline PWA cache before demo video"
}

### 9.4 List Scratchpad Captures
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/capture
Content-Type: application/json

### 9.5 Delete Scratchpad Capture
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/capture/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json


### 10. DEV TOOLS (Active with 'dev' profile)

### 10.1 Set Simulated Event Clock
POST {{baseUrl}}/dev/rooms/{{roomId}}/set-clock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hourOfEvent": 39
}

### 10.2 Simulate Automated Progress
POST {{baseUrl}}/dev/rooms/{{roomId}}/simulate-progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "percent": 60
}
